title: "Own the Knowledge. Rent the Thinking. Separating institutional understanding from frontier intelligence"
type: report
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22775192"
identifiers:
  - type: other
    value: "Acropolis, a governed model of the organization: Technical Report 01"
    description: "Report number; DOI to be assigned at publication"
