url: "https://varops.com"
abstract: >-
  Institutional understanding and frontier reasoning can be separated. Across
  LongMemEval-S, LoCoMo and BEAM 100K, replacing the model that builds the
  organizational record with a locally operated 31B open-weight model changes
  downstream frontier performance by one to two points; keeping the entire system
  local retains 84 to 96 percent of all-frontier performance, and renting a frontier
  model only for per-question answering raises that to 96 to 99 percent.
keywords:
  - enterprise AI
  - governed knowledge substrate
